WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.458
[MUSIC PLAYING]
[音乐播放中]

00:00:16.993 --> 00:00:19.160
BRIAN YU: Welcome back, everyone, to an introduction
布莱恩·余：欢迎大家回到用Scratch学编程的课程。

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:20.510
to programming with Scratch.
上次我们了解了事件，也就是可能发生的事情——

00:00:20.510 --> 00:00:24.050
And last time we took a look at Events, things that can happen--
比如我们点击绿色旗帜，或者点击按钮，

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:26.660
like us pressing the green flag, or clicking a button,
又或者按下键盘上的某个键——然后让

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:28.730
or pressing a key on the keyboard-- and letting
我们的Scratch项目对这些事件做出响应。

00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:31.670
our Scratch project respond to those events.
它们是如何响应的呢？

00:00:31.670 --> 00:00:32.930
And how do they respond?
嗯，它们通过函数来响应，就是那些

00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:34.970
Well, they respond with Functions, those blocks
我们相互堆叠起来的积木，让我们的角色或舞台

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:38.480
that we stacked on top of each other to let our sprites or the stage
以某种方式做出响应。

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:40.590
respond in some way.
所以今天让我们更深入地了解一下这些函数——

00:00:40.590 --> 00:00:43.970
And so let's take a closer look today at those Functions--
我们已经看到，比如我们可以让猫移动，

00:00:43.970 --> 00:00:47.600
we've seen already that we can have the cat move, for example,
只需要使用这样一个积木——

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:49.040
just by using a block like this--
“移动10步”——这样当我点击这个积木时，

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:52.940
Move 10 Steps-- such that when I click on this block,
猫就会移动10步。

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:55.580
the cat moves by 10 steps.
之前我们讨论过，这些函数，也就是这些积木，

00:00:55.580 --> 00:00:59.090
And we discussed before that these Functions, these blocks,
可以接受输入。

00:00:59.090 --> 00:01:00.470
can accept input.
输入的形式就是填入这个椭圆里的内容，

00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:02.750
Input in the form of whatever goes in this oval
这里默认是10——但我们可以更改它。

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:05.630
here, which is 10 by default-- but we were able to change that.
如果我们想让猫移动更多或更少的步数，

00:01:05.630 --> 00:01:09.470
If we wanted the cat to move more steps or fewer steps,
我们可以更改这里的数字，来控制猫最终

00:01:09.470 --> 00:01:14.450
we were able to change the number here to control how many steps the cat was
要移动多少步。

00:01:14.450 --> 00:01:15.530
ultimately going to move.
这又被称为输入，而填入这个输入的实际信息

00:01:15.530 --> 00:01:19.730
That, again, was called an input, and the actual information that goes inside
我们可以称之为值。

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:22.160
of that input we might call a value.
值只是一些信息——在这种情况下，

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:24.733
A value is just some piece of information-- in this case,
它可以是像数字这样的东西，比如要移动的步数——

00:01:24.733 --> 00:01:26.900
it could be something like a number, like the number
就像数字10。

00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:28.760
of steps to move-- like the number 10.
但值也可以是文字，例如——

00:01:28.760 --> 00:01:31.590
But a value could also be words, for example--
你可能还记得，我们可以让我们的角色说话，

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:34.340
you might recall that we were able to make our sprite speak up
如果我们进入“外观”板块并选择

00:01:34.340 --> 00:01:36.710
if we go into the Look section and choose
像“说你好2秒”这样的积木。

00:01:36.710 --> 00:01:39.830
a block like Say Hello For 2 Seconds.
在这里，“你好”这个词也是一个值——值只是

00:01:39.830 --> 00:01:43.640
Here, the word "Hello" is a value as well-- values are just
我们的程序可能会用到的信息片段。

00:01:43.640 --> 00:01:48.030
pieces of information that our program might be able to use.
事实证明，除了我们可以直接在Scratch函数的这些椭圆形空间中输入值之外，

00:01:48.030 --> 00:01:51.950
And it turns out, in addition to us just being able to type values
Scratch中还有一些积木本身就是值，

00:01:51.950 --> 00:01:55.940
into these oval-shaped spaces inside of our Scratch functions,
今天我们就要来探索这些。

00:01:55.940 --> 00:02:00.170
there are some blocks in Scratch that are themselves values,
所以如果你注意到这里“运动”板块的积木，大多数这些积木

00:02:00.170 --> 00:02:03.030
and today we're going to be exploring those.
形状都非常相似。

00:02:03.030 --> 00:02:07.130
So if you notice here in the Motion section of blocks, most of these blocks
所以如果你留意这里运动类积木，大部分这些积木

00:02:07.130 --> 00:02:08.690
are all a very similar shape.
形状都非常相似。

00:02:08.690 --> 00:02:12.048
Some might be longer or shorter, but they're all kind of rectangular,
有些可能长些或短些，但它们大体都是矩形的，

00:02:12.048 --> 00:02:14.090
and they have these indentations so that they can
而且它们有这些凹槽，这样它们就能

00:02:14.090 --> 00:02:16.730
stack on top of each other visually.
在视觉上相互堆叠。

00:02:16.730 --> 00:02:21.110
But you'll notice that down here, at the bottom of the Motion section,
但你会注意到，在“运动”板块的底部这里，

00:02:21.110 --> 00:02:24.180
we have a few blocks that are a different shape.
有几个积木的形状不同。

00:02:24.180 --> 00:02:26.760
This one's called X Position, this one's called Y Position,
这个叫“X坐标”，这个叫“Y坐标”，

00:02:26.760 --> 00:02:29.390
this one's called Direction-- they're not rectangular,
这个叫“方向”——它们不是矩形的，

00:02:29.390 --> 00:02:31.020
they don't stack on top of each other.
它们不能相互堆叠。

00:02:31.020 --> 00:02:32.990
And in fact, we wouldn't be able to just drag
事实上，我们不能直接把

00:02:32.990 --> 00:02:36.590
this underneath the existing blocks and expect them to snap together.
这个拖到现有积木下面，还指望它们能拼接在一起。

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:38.660
Scratch is a little bit smart, and it's only
Scratch 有点智能，它只会

00:02:38.660 --> 00:02:40.890
going to allow blocks to connect to each other
允许那些在逻辑上能相互连接的积木连接在一起。

00:02:40.890 --> 00:02:44.510
if it makes logical sense for those blocks to connect to each other.
相反，这三个积木是椭圆形的——

00:02:44.510 --> 00:02:47.910
Instead, these three blocks are oval shaped--
它们不再是函数了，而是值。

00:02:47.910 --> 00:02:50.420
they're not functions anymore, they're values.
它们是代表当前正在运行的 Scratch 项目相关信息的片段。

00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:54.470
They're pieces of information that represent something about the Scratch
这个积木是一个值，它代表

00:02:54.470 --> 00:02:56.060
project that we're currently running.
当前角色的 X 坐标是多少——也就是这个角色在左右方向上有多远。

00:02:56.060 --> 00:02:58.310
This block is a value that represents what
这个积木代表当前角色的 X 坐标——也就是这个角色在左右方向上有多远。

00:02:58.310 --> 00:03:02.300
is the x position of a current sprite-- how far to the left or to the right
这个角色在左右方向上的位置。

00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:03.350
is that sprite.
这个积木代表 Y 坐标，也就是

00:03:03.350 --> 00:03:05.510
This block represents the y position, how far
这个角色在上下方向上有多远。

00:03:05.510 --> 00:03:07.740
up or down that sprite happens to be.
这个角色在上下方向上的位置。

00:03:07.740 --> 00:03:11.540
And this block represents the direction-- what direction that sprite
这个积木代表方向——也就是这个角色

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:12.920
happens to be facing.
正朝向哪个方向。

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:15.170
And because they're oval-shaped, we can't just
因为它们是椭圆形的，我们不能直接

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:19.490
add them above or below the script, but we can put them inside
把它们添加到脚本的上方或下方，但我们可以把它们放到

00:03:19.490 --> 00:03:21.140
of these oval-shaped inputs.
这些椭圆形的输入框里。

00:03:21.140 --> 00:03:24.170
Notice the inputs to all of the functions are oval-shaped--
注意所有函数的输入框都是椭圆形的——

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:27.320
and therefore, because these values are also oval-shaped,
因此，由于这些值也是椭圆形的，

00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:29.960
they can snap together that way instead.
它们可以以这种方式拼接在一起。

00:03:29.960 --> 00:03:34.590
We're going to be putting a block inside of the input to another block,
我们要把一个积木放到另一个积木的输入框里，

00:03:34.590 --> 00:03:36.750
so let's see what that looks like.
那我们来看看这会是什么样子。

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:41.270
I'll go ahead and get rid of the Move 10 Steps-- we'll just keep the Say Hello.
我先把“移动10步”删掉——我们只保留“说你好”。

00:03:41.270 --> 00:03:43.910
But instead of saying hello for two seconds,
但不是让角色说两秒“你好”，

00:03:43.910 --> 00:03:49.820
let's have the sprite say it's x position for two seconds--
让角色说两秒它的 X 坐标——

00:03:49.820 --> 00:03:56.210
meaning how far to the left or to the right is the cat right now.
也就是这只猫现在在左右方向上有多远。

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:59.150
And I'll have this happen when the flag is clicked, so add an Event--
我想让这个操作在点击绿旗时执行，所以添加一个“事件”——

00:03:59.150 --> 00:04:03.980
when the flag is clicked, go ahead and say your x position for two seconds,
当点击绿旗时，就说你的 X 坐标两秒，

00:04:03.980 --> 00:04:06.330
and now when I click the flag to start the program--
现在我点击绿旗来启动程序——

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:08.360
let's see what happens.
看看会发生什么。

00:04:08.360 --> 00:04:10.100
The cat says 10--
这只猫说10——

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:12.380
it's saying its current x position, which we can
它在说出它当前的x坐标，我们可以

00:04:12.380 --> 00:04:14.840
see down here it's exposition is 10.
在这里看到它的坐标值是10。

00:04:14.840 --> 00:04:18.547
And if we drag the cat far to the right, for example, now click the green flag,
例如，如果我们把猫往右边拖很远，现在点击绿色旗帜，

00:04:18.547 --> 00:04:20.630
and you'll see it's going to say a bigger number--
你会看到它会说出一个更大的数字——

00:04:20.630 --> 00:04:22.250
175.
175。

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:24.620
And if we drag the cat far to the left, now it's
如果我们把猫往左边拖很远，现在它

00:04:24.620 --> 00:04:26.300
going to say a smaller number--
会说出一个更小的数字——

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:30.140
negative 161.
负161。

00:04:30.140 --> 00:04:34.610
And if we want, we can have it say both its x position and its y position.
如果我们愿意，我们可以让它同时说出它的x坐标和y坐标。

00:04:34.610 --> 00:04:38.870
I'll add another Say block, and instead of saying the x position,
我要再添加一个“说”积木，而且不说x坐标了，

00:04:38.870 --> 00:04:44.390
let's go back into Motion, and let's choose y position.
我们回到“运动”分类，选择y坐标。

00:04:44.390 --> 00:04:47.180
Now it's going to say it's x value for two seconds,
现在它会先说两秒它的x坐标值，

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:49.300
and then it's y value for two seconds.
然后再说两秒它的y坐标值。

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:51.330
I'll click the green flag--
我点击绿色旗帜——

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:55.730
it says negative 161, negative 13.
它说负161，负13。

00:04:55.730 --> 00:05:00.140
And so these values, these oval-shaped x position and y position blocks,
所以这些值，这些椭圆形的x坐标和y坐标积木，

00:05:00.140 --> 00:05:02.090
they're no longer functions-- these are just
它们不再是函数了——这些只是

00:05:02.090 --> 00:05:06.500
values that we can put in any spot inside of our functions
我们可以放在函数里任何有椭圆形输入框位置的值

00:05:06.500 --> 00:05:08.210
where they have an oval-shaped input.
也就是我们可以往那个椭圆形框里添加内容的地方。

00:05:08.210 --> 00:05:11.960
Where we could add something into that oval to describe how what
在这里我们可以往那个椭圆形框里添加内容来描述我们

00:05:11.960 --> 00:05:15.320
we want the cat, in this case, to say.
希望这只猫，在这个例子里，要说什么。

00:05:15.320 --> 00:05:18.030
And right now, it's saying the x position for two seconds
现在，它先说两秒x坐标值，

00:05:18.030 --> 00:05:21.130
and then it's y value for two seconds, which is fine,
然后再说两秒y坐标值，这没问题，

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:23.490
but maybe I'd like the cat to say them together.
但也许我希望这只猫把它们一起说出来。

00:05:23.490 --> 00:05:26.170
To say, like, here's where I am right now.
比如说，像这样：这就是我现在的位置。

00:05:26.170 --> 00:05:29.280
And to do that, I need some way of combining these values--
要做到这一点，我需要某种方法来组合这些值——

00:05:29.280 --> 00:05:33.932
I need to combine the x location and the y location of this cat.
我需要把这只猫的x坐标和y坐标组合起来。

00:05:33.932 --> 00:05:35.640
And here's where we're going to introduce
接下来我们要引入

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:39.180
another new concept within Scratch, and within programming more generally--
Scratch里的另一个新概念，也是编程里更普遍的概念——

00:05:39.180 --> 00:05:41.640
and those are Operators.
那就是运算符。

00:05:41.640 --> 00:05:46.170
An Operator is going to accept values as its own input,
运算符会接受值作为它自己的输入，

00:05:46.170 --> 00:05:49.590
and the Operator is going to produce a new value for us.
然后运算符会为我们生成一个新的值。

00:05:49.590 --> 00:05:53.580
And so one Operator, for example, this very first one is +.
比如说，有一个运算符，第一个就是“+”。

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:57.120
It will take two values, maybe like 1 and 2 and we add them together
它会接受两个值，比如1和2，然后我们把它们加起来

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:58.500
and it's going to give us 3.
它会得到3。

00:05:58.500 --> 00:05:59.970
So, what would that look like?
那么，这会是什么样子呢？

00:05:59.970 --> 00:06:03.450
I'll disconnect these for now just so we can try something a little different.
我先把这些积木断开，这样我们可以试试有点不一样的东西。

00:06:03.450 --> 00:06:07.140
I'll go into Looks, have it say something for 2 seconds,
我进入“外观”分类，让它说两秒内容，

00:06:07.140 --> 00:06:12.990
but instead of saying hello for two seconds, let's have it say 1 plus 2
但不是说两秒“你好”，让它说“1加2”

00:06:12.990 --> 00:06:15.240
for two seconds.
持续两秒。

00:06:15.240 --> 00:06:19.380
Now I press the green flag to start the program and the cat says 3--
现在我点击绿色旗帜来启动程序，然后猫会说3——

00:06:19.380 --> 00:06:24.190
this operator, this green block here, is performing the task of addition.
这个运算符，就是这里这个绿色积木，它的任务是进行加法运算。

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:29.640
It accepts two inputs, two values of its own as inputs, the 1 and the 2--
它接受两个输入，也就是它自身的两个值作为输入，1和2——

00:06:29.640 --> 00:06:33.660
and then this entire oval block is going to calculate what is 1 plus 2,
然后整个椭圆形积木会计算1加2等于多少，

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:34.920
it's going to be 3.
结果会是3。

00:06:34.920 --> 00:06:37.440
And because that's inside of the Say block,
因为这个结果在“说”积木里面，

00:06:37.440 --> 00:06:42.820
now the cat is going to say the number 3 for two seconds.
现在猫会在两秒内说出数字3。

00:06:42.820 --> 00:06:45.730
And so we have blocks to perform math like addition, subtraction,
所以我们有用于进行数学运算的积木，比如加法、减法，

00:06:45.730 --> 00:06:47.500
multiplication, and division.
乘法和除法。

00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:50.250
We have other blocks, as well, and the one I'm interested in right
我们还有其他的积木，而我现在感兴趣的是

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:52.920
now is this one down here called Join.
下面这个叫“连接”的积木。

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:55.710
Right now, it says Join Apple and Banana--
现在，它显示的是连接“苹果”和“香蕉”——

00:06:55.710 --> 00:06:59.340
you could use this for any characters we might want to join together.
你可以用它来连接任何我们想要组合在一起的字符。

00:06:59.340 --> 00:07:03.960
And what it's going to do is it's going to take two different values,
它要做的就是接收两个不同的值，

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:07.440
and it's just going to combine them together into one.
然后把它们组合成一个。

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:12.180
And so I would like to combine together the x location of the cat in addition
所以我想把猫的x坐标位置和

00:07:12.180 --> 00:07:13.890
to the y location of the cat--
猫的y坐标位置组合在一起——

00:07:13.890 --> 00:07:18.930
and so let's use the Join operator to do just that.
那我们就用“连接”运算符来实现这个功能。

00:07:18.930 --> 00:07:21.630
I'll get rid of this block that was just doing some math
我把这个只是做了些数学运算的积木删掉，

00:07:21.630 --> 00:07:25.980
and instead take this Join block, and I want to join together
然后用这个“连接”积木，我想把

00:07:25.980 --> 00:07:29.550
the X Position and the Y Position.
x坐标位置和y坐标位置连接起来。

00:07:29.550 --> 00:07:33.450
Notice that these ovals snap into place because the two inputs in the join
注意，这些椭圆形积木能准确拼接，因为“连接”积木的两个输入也是椭圆形的——

00:07:33.450 --> 00:07:36.150
block are also oval-shaped--
现在我不需要两个“说”积木了，只需要一个。

00:07:36.150 --> 00:07:38.640
now I don't need two Says, I only need one.
我们把这个“连接”积木放到“说”积木里面——

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:42.960
And let's take this Join block and put it inside of the Say block--
注意，“说”积木也会变大，以便为现在放在里面的积木腾出空间。

00:07:42.960 --> 00:07:46.650
and notice the Say block too will grow in order to make room
现在我有一个积木套着一个积木，又套着另一个积木——

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:48.330
for the block that's inside of it now.
“说”积木里面有“连接”积木，

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:51.690
And now I have a block inside of a block inside of another block--
“连接”积木里面还有x和y的值。

00:07:51.690 --> 00:07:54.240
the same block has this Join block in it,
所以现在当我点击绿色旗帜时，注意会发生什么——

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:59.680
and inside the Join block are the x and y values as well.
它会说“负161 负13”，而且它们都挤在一起，

00:07:59.680 --> 00:08:03.810
And so now when I press the green flag, notice what happens--
我可能都不知道那个坐标具体在哪里。

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:09.600
it says negative 161 negative 13, and it was all kind of mashed together,
所以如果我愿意，我可以更换背景——给我自己弄个网格，

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:12.220
and I might not even know exactly where that coordinate is.
我觉得如果我搜索“网格”，应该会有一个网格背景。

00:08:12.220 --> 00:08:18.073
So if I wanted to, I could change the backdrop-- let's give myself a grid,
没错，这里有个xy网格——

00:08:18.073 --> 00:08:20.490
I think there's a grid backdrop if I do a search for grid.
这样我就能在xy网格上大致看到猫在这个平面上的位置。

00:08:20.490 --> 00:08:22.140
Yeah, here's an xy grid--
我再点击一次——

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:26.910
so I can see on an xy grid kind of where the cat is on this plane.
负161 负13。

00:08:26.910 --> 00:08:28.800
I'll press it again--
我再按一次——

00:08:28.800 --> 00:08:30.679
minus 161 minus 13.
减161再减13。

00:08:30.679 --> 00:08:32.429
That's fine, but maybe if you've used math
没问题，但如果你之前学过数学

00:08:32.429 --> 00:08:36.502
before, you're more used to x comma y, you see one value comma
你可能更习惯用 x，y 这种形式，也就是一个值，逗号

00:08:36.502 --> 00:08:39.210
another value instead of them just being right next to each other
另一个值，而不是它们紧挨着

00:08:39.210 --> 00:08:41.870
without even a space in between them.
中间连个空格都没有。

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:42.870
So how could we do that?
那我们该怎么做呢？

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:47.160
How could we add a comma just to separate the x value from the y value
怎样才能加个逗号，把 x 值和 y 值

00:08:47.160 --> 00:08:48.840
a little bit more?
分得更开一点呢？

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:52.282
Well, I can use another Join--
嗯，我可以再用一个“连接”积木——

00:08:52.282 --> 00:08:54.240
this is going to look a little bit complicated,
这看起来会有点复杂，

00:08:54.240 --> 00:08:55.680
but here's what I'm going to do.
但我接下来要这么做。

00:08:55.680 --> 00:09:00.030
Instead of joining together the X Position and the Y Position,
我不直接把 x 坐标和 y 坐标连接起来，

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:06.720
let me first take a comma and a space, and join that with the Y Position.
我先拿一个逗号和一个空格，把它们和 y 坐标连接起来。

00:09:06.720 --> 00:09:11.185
And then put that Join inside of the input to the other Join--
然后把这个“连接”积木放到另一个“连接”积木的输入框里——

00:09:11.185 --> 00:09:13.560
so this is starting to get a little bit more complicated,
所以这开始变得有点复杂了，

00:09:13.560 --> 00:09:15.480
but let's try and break down exactly what's happening here.
但我们试着仔细分析一下这里到底在做什么。

00:09:15.480 --> 00:09:18.300
I've got a lot of blocks nested inside of other blocks,
我有很多积木嵌套在其他积木里面，

00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:20.520
but here I'm saying something-- what am I saying?
但我在这里表达了一个意思——我在表达什么呢？

00:09:20.520 --> 00:09:22.560
Well, I'm joining together these two things--
嗯，我在把这两样东西连接起来——

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:27.152
I'm joining the x value of the cat and this block here.
我在把猫的 x 坐标和这里这个积木连接起来。

00:09:27.152 --> 00:09:28.110
And what is this block?
那这个积木是做什么的呢？

00:09:28.110 --> 00:09:32.640
Well, that block is joining together a comma and the y value
嗯，那个积木是把一个逗号和猫所在位置的 y 坐标连接起来。

00:09:32.640 --> 00:09:34.720
of wherever the cat happens to be.
不管猫碰巧在哪里。

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:38.570
So taken all together, what does this big oval now do?
那么综合起来，这个大椭圆积木现在有什么作用呢？

00:09:38.570 --> 00:09:42.330
Well, it's going to take the X Position, and then take a comma, and then
嗯，它会获取 x 坐标，然后加一个逗号，接着

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:45.600
the Y Position, and that all together is going to be
获取 y 坐标，所有这些合起来会是

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:48.945
what goes inside of the Say block.
显示在“说”积木里的内容。

00:09:48.945 --> 00:09:51.570
So we're starting to nest a lot of blocks inside of each other,
所以我们开始把很多积木嵌套在一起了，

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:54.240
but the net result is that, if I take the cat
但最终的结果是，如果我移动这只猫

00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:59.400
and move it to near the middle of the stage, for example--
比如把它移到舞台中间附近——

00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:00.750
press the green flag--
点击绿色小旗——

00:10:00.750 --> 00:10:05.040
it's going to say 4 comma 3, that's where in the world it happens to be.
它会显示 4，3，这就是它在舞台上的位置。

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:08.140
If I move its location somewhere else and press the flag again,
如果我把它移到其他地方，再点击小旗，

00:10:08.140 --> 00:10:10.720
it's going to give me some different numbers.
它会显示不同的数字。

00:10:10.720 --> 00:10:15.580
But now it's saying it all at once, one value comma another value.
但现在它会一次性显示出来，一个值，逗号，另一个值。

00:10:15.580 --> 00:10:17.820
And if I wanted to make this a complete sentence,
如果我想把它变成一个完整的句子，

00:10:17.820 --> 00:10:23.430
I can even add one more Join n-- let me say, I am at--
我甚至可以再用一个“连接”积木——比如说，我在——

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:27.570
and then take this whole big Join block that Says position, and put that
然后把这个显示位置的大“连接”积木，放到

00:10:27.570 --> 00:10:32.340
on the other side of the Join, and now have the cat say all of this.
“连接”积木的另一边，现在让猫说出所有这些内容。

00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:39.000
"I am at x comma y," and so now if I drag it down here, it says,
“我在 x，y 处”，所以现在如果我把它拖到这里，它会显示，

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:44.700
"I am at negative 30 comma negative 96. " If I drag it here, the cat says,
“我在 -30，-96 处”。如果我把它拖到这里，猫会说，

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:51.300
"I am at 49 comma 61," and so using these values and operators we can start
“我在坐标（49, 61）处”，所以利用这些值和运算符，我们可以开始

00:10:51.300 --> 00:10:56.100
to combine values together and start to make some more interesting projects
将值组合起来，并且也能开始制作一些更有趣的项目。

00:10:56.100 --> 00:10:57.730
as well.
同样。

00:10:57.730 --> 00:11:00.930
And we did this just now with the X Position and the Y Position,
我们刚才在处理X坐标和Y坐标时就是这么做的，

00:11:00.930 --> 00:11:04.140
but there's also this Direction block that we could do this with too.
但还有这个方向积木，我们也可以用它来做类似的事。

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:06.870
If we wanted the cat to, not only say where it is,
如果我们想让猫不仅说出它在哪里，

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:10.620
but also what direction it's facing, you could imagine using that Direction
还说出它面朝哪个方向，你可以想象使用那个方向

00:11:10.620 --> 00:11:14.260
block-- so the cat could say, "I am pointing at 90 degree angle,"
积木——这样猫就可以说：“我正指向90度角的方向”，

00:11:14.260 --> 00:11:17.230
or "I'm pointing at a 45 degree angle" for example--
或者比如说“我正指向45度角的方向”——

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:22.983
and we could have it use that value inside of its blocks as well.
而且我们也可以让它在积木里使用那个值。

00:11:22.983 --> 00:11:24.900
So let's try something a little different now,
那么现在让我们尝试点有点不一样的东西，

00:11:24.900 --> 00:11:27.460
we've taken a look at these motion values--
我们已经看过这些移动相关的值了——

00:11:27.460 --> 00:11:29.490
let's look at what other values we might have.
让我们看看还有哪些其他的值。

00:11:29.490 --> 00:11:32.340
I'll keep scrolling down inside of Scratch's interface,
我会继续在Scratch的界面里往下滚动，

00:11:32.340 --> 00:11:35.430
and under the Look section we have a whole bunch of other functions
在外观板块下，我们有一大堆之前用过的其他功能，

00:11:35.430 --> 00:11:37.620
that we've used before-- we've used the Say block,
我们用过说积木，

00:11:37.620 --> 00:11:40.920
we've used the Switch Costume, and Switch Backdrop blocks,
我们用过切换造型和切换背景积木，

00:11:40.920 --> 00:11:42.940
we've used Change Size.
我们用过改变大小积木。

00:11:42.940 --> 00:11:44.910
Notice down below though--
不过注意下面——

00:11:44.910 --> 00:11:49.500
we also have a couple of blocks that are not the shape of the normal Functions,
我们还有几个积木不是普通功能积木的形状，

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:52.770
they're instead oval-shaped meaning they are values.
它们是椭圆形的，这意味着它们是值。

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:56.520
We have one for the Costume number, we have one for the Backdrop number,
我们有一个是造型编号的，有一个是背景编号的，

00:11:56.520 --> 00:11:58.800
and we have one just called Size--
还有一个就叫大小——

00:11:58.800 --> 00:12:02.580
and Size in this case is going to represent how big or small
在这种情况下，大小将表示我们的角色

00:12:02.580 --> 00:12:03.360
our sprite is.
有多大或多小。

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:06.180
Remember that our sprites start out at 100% size,
记得我们的角色一开始大小是100%，

00:12:06.180 --> 00:12:08.790
but we have already seen how we can make them smaller
但我们已经知道如何让它们变小，

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:10.720
or we can make them bigger.
或者让它们变大。

00:12:10.720 --> 00:12:13.350
So, when might we want to use something like the Size block
那么，我们什么时候会想使用像大小积木这样的东西，

00:12:13.350 --> 00:12:17.220
to know how big or small a particular sprite is?
来了解某个特定角色的大小呢？

00:12:17.220 --> 00:12:18.520
Well, let's take an example--
嗯，让我们举个例子——

00:12:18.520 --> 00:12:20.760
let's imagine we're not using the cat anymore,
让我们想象我们不再用猫这个角色了，

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:24.630
I'll go ahead and delete the cat, and I'll change the backdrop back
我这就把猫删掉，然后我把背景换回

00:12:24.630 --> 00:12:27.090
to our plain white backdrop.
我们的纯白色背景。

00:12:27.090 --> 00:12:33.570
Let's pick out a new sprite, go into Animals, and let's grab the hedgehog.
让我们选一个新角色，进入动物类别，然后选刺猬这个角色。

00:12:33.570 --> 00:12:36.060
And if I wanted the hedgehog to move, I want
如果我想让刺猬移动，我希望

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:39.480
the hedgehog to move every time I press the right arrow, for example--
比如说每次我按右方向键时刺猬就移动——

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:41.100
we saw last time how we could do that.
我们上次已经知道该怎么做了。

00:12:41.100 --> 00:12:44.310
I add an Event saying, not when the Space key is pressed,
我添加一个事件，不是当按下空格键时，

00:12:44.310 --> 00:12:46.500
but when the Right arrow is pressed.
而是当按下右方向键时。

00:12:46.500 --> 00:12:51.810
Now I want the hedgehog to move 10 steps, so drag it over to the left,
现在我想让刺猬移动10步，所以把它拖到左边，

00:12:51.810 --> 00:12:55.380
I press the right arrow, and it's moving.
我按右箭头，它就移动了。

00:12:55.380 --> 00:12:59.340
And that seems like a reasonable pace for a hedgehog of about that size,
对于那么大的刺猬来说，这个速度似乎挺合适的，

00:12:59.340 --> 00:13:03.570
but if I made the hedgehog much smaller and sprite 50%.
但如果我把刺猬缩小到原来的50%。

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:05.812
And now have it move--
现在让它移动——

00:13:05.812 --> 00:13:07.770
notice that it's moving-- because it's smaller,
注意它在移动——因为它变小了，

00:13:07.770 --> 00:13:09.810
it's still moving 10 steps every time.
它每次还是移动10步。

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:12.960
It's moving maybe a little bit fast for how big it is--
就它的大小而言，它移动得可能有点快了——

00:13:12.960 --> 00:13:15.540
I might like to change this so that my program's
我可能想改一下，这样我的程序

00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:20.010
a little bit more responsive to how big or small a sprite happens to be.
能更根据角色的大小做出相应调整。

00:13:20.010 --> 00:13:23.070
If a sprite is bigger, then it's probably taking bigger steps,
如果一个角色更大，那它可能迈的步子更大，

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:24.980
so I want it to move more every time.
所以我想让它每次移动得更多。

00:13:24.980 --> 00:13:26.730
And if a sprite a smaller, well, then it's
如果一个角色更小，那么它

00:13:26.730 --> 00:13:32.110
probably taking smaller steps, so I want it to move less every time.
可能迈的步子更小，所以我想让它每次移动得更少。

00:13:32.110 --> 00:13:34.560
And so instead of moving 10 steps--
所以，不要每次移动10步——

00:13:34.560 --> 00:13:39.360
I'll change the size back to 100, but instead of moving 10 steps,
我把大小改回100，但不移动10步，

00:13:39.360 --> 00:13:43.320
let's have it move Size steps.
让它移动“大小”步数。

00:13:43.320 --> 00:13:48.090
Size is a value representing how big or small the hedgehog is,
“大小”是一个代表刺猬大小的值，

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:51.600
and I'll drag it inside this oval shape input-- it snaps right into place
我把它拖到这个椭圆形输入框里——它正好卡进去了

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:53.310
because it is oval-sized.
因为它是椭圆形大小的。

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:55.990
And now, instead of moving 10 steps every time,
现在，它不再每次移动10步，

00:13:55.990 --> 00:13:59.040
it's going to move a number of steps dependent upon the size
而是要根据刺猬的大小移动相应步数。

00:13:59.040 --> 00:14:00.300
of the hedgehog.
因为这只刺猬大小是100%，所以现在我按右箭头时，

00:14:00.300 --> 00:14:05.460
And so because this hedgehog is 100% size, now when I press the Right arrow,
它每次移动100步。

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:08.050
it's moving 100 steps every time.
这可能太快了，我想稍微减慢一点——

00:14:08.050 --> 00:14:11.380
That's probably too fast, I want to cut down on this a little bit--
这时我们就可以开始做点儿数学运算了。

00:14:11.380 --> 00:14:14.950
and here is where we can start to do maybe a little bit of math.
我们进入“运算”模块，用“除法”——

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:18.300
Let's go into Operators and let's use Division--
我可以用除法来减小某个数值

00:14:18.300 --> 00:14:20.760
Division I can use to cut down on the size of something
让数字变小。

00:14:20.760 --> 00:14:22.200
make the numbers smaller.
我们用“大小”除以10，你可以多试试

00:14:22.200 --> 00:14:26.070
Let's do Size divided by 10, you could play around with this
然后决定你想要的数值。

00:14:26.070 --> 00:14:28.122
and decide what you want it to be.
那么，现在会发生什么呢？

00:14:28.122 --> 00:14:29.580
And so, now what's going to happen?
我们来稍微分析一下这里的数学运算——

00:14:29.580 --> 00:14:32.070
Let's try and analyze the math of this a little bit--
如果刺猬的大小是100，也就是它一开始是完整大小，

00:14:32.070 --> 00:14:36.540
if the size of the hedgehog is 100, meaning it's full size to begin with,
那么每次我按右箭头键——

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:38.820
then every time I press the Right arrow key--
我们要移动“大小”除以10步。

00:14:38.820 --> 00:14:41.700
we're going to move Size divided by 10 steps.
大小是100，除以10就是10，

00:14:41.700 --> 00:14:45.640
The size is 100 divided by 10 is just 10,
所以刺猬会移动10步。

00:14:45.640 --> 00:14:49.013
and so the hedgehog is going to move 10 steps.
如果刺猬更小会怎样呢？

00:14:49.013 --> 00:14:50.430
What if the hedgehog were smaller?
如果刺猬更小会怎样呢？

00:14:50.430 --> 00:14:52.230
What if the size was 50?
如果大小设为50会怎样？

00:14:52.230 --> 00:14:55.677
Well, then the hedgehog is going to move 50 divided by 10 steps,
那么，刺猬会移动50除以10步，

00:14:55.677 --> 00:14:57.510
meaning it's only going to move five steps--
也就是说它只会移动5步——

00:14:57.510 --> 00:14:59.795
smaller steps for a smaller hedgehog.
小刺猬移动的步数更少。

00:14:59.795 --> 00:15:01.170
What if the hedgehog were bigger?
如果刺猬更大呢？

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:03.090
What if it was size of 200?
如果它的大小是200会怎样？

00:15:03.090 --> 00:15:06.310
Well, then it's going to move at 200 divided by 10 steps--
那么，它会移动200除以10步——

00:15:06.310 --> 00:15:09.630
in other words, it's going to move 20 steps every time
换句话说，每次我们按下右箭头，它会移动20步。

00:15:09.630 --> 00:15:10.620
we hit the Right arrow.
每次我们按下右箭头。

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:14.970
It's moving more steps because it's a bigger animal.
它移动的步数更多，因为它是更大的动物。

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:19.640
And so now when I press Right arrow, it's moving 10 steps every time.
所以现在当我按下右箭头时，它每次移动10步。

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:23.750
If I change the size of the hedgehog and make it a little bit smaller, size 15,
如果我改变刺猬的大小，把它变小一点，设为大小15，

00:15:23.750 --> 00:15:28.140
now it's moving only five steps every time I press the Right arrow.
现在每次我按下右箭头，它只移动5步。

00:15:28.140 --> 00:15:31.700
And if I make it bigger, make it size 200,
如果我把它变大，设为大小200，

00:15:31.700 --> 00:15:39.240
now it's going to be moving 20 steps every time I press the arrow as well.
现在每次我按下箭头，它也会移动20步。

00:15:39.240 --> 00:15:43.220
And so we can start to use these values to get information about our sprite--
所以我们可以开始利用这些值来获取关于我们角色的信息——

00:15:43.220 --> 00:15:45.020
where it is in the world, how big or small
它在场景中的位置，它的大小

00:15:45.020 --> 00:15:48.500
it is, and use that to affect the way that our program behaves.
然后用这些信息来影响我们程序的运行方式。

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:50.840
By using, not just values that we type in,
不仅要利用我们输入的值，

00:15:50.840 --> 00:15:57.660
but by using values that are given to us as part of Scratch to make it work too.
也要利用Scratch提供给我们的值来让程序运行。

00:15:57.660 --> 00:16:00.500
And so, I'll go ahead and change the size back to 100.
所以，我要把大小改回100。

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:04.100
I'll go ahead and center the hedgehog again so it's back in the middle,
我要再次把刺猬移到中心，让它回到中间位置，

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:06.650
and let's try something else fun in these Operators.
让我们在这些运算积木里试试其他有趣的东西。

00:16:06.650 --> 00:16:09.080
One thing I'm noticing in these Operators
我在这些运算积木里注意到一件事

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:11.750
is that we can do math-- we've seen like addition, and division,
我们可以做数学运算——我们已经看到了加法和除法，

00:16:11.750 --> 00:16:14.390
and there's also subtraction, and multiplication.
还有减法和乘法。

00:16:14.390 --> 00:16:17.300
We've seen how we can join two words together
我们已经看到如何用这个“连接苹果和香蕉”积木把两个单词连在一起。

00:16:17.300 --> 00:16:19.973
with this Join Apple and Banana block.
用这个“连接苹果和香蕉”积木把两个单词连在一起。

00:16:19.973 --> 00:16:21.890
There's another block that looks interesting--
还有另一个看起来很有趣的积木——

00:16:21.890 --> 00:16:25.310
Pick Random 1 To 10.
随机选取1到10。

00:16:25.310 --> 00:16:27.290
Pick Random 1 To 10 is a type of block that's
“随机选取1到10”是一种积木，

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:30.680
going to let us add a little bit of randomness into our project.
它能让我们在项目中加入一点随机性。

00:16:30.680 --> 00:16:34.520
Right now, most of our projects are just doing the same thing every time--
目前，我们的大多数项目每次运行都做同样的事情——

00:16:34.520 --> 00:16:36.990
unless we use the Random Position movement,
除非我们使用“随机位置”移动，

00:16:36.990 --> 00:16:38.540
which we used a couple of times.
我们用过几次这个。

00:16:38.540 --> 00:16:41.600
But Pick Random will just pick a random number for us
但是“随机选取”会为我们随机选一个数字，

00:16:41.600 --> 00:16:44.060
so that we can let the project do something
这样我们就能让项目每次运行时做不同的事情。

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:47.280
different each time we run the project.
这样我们就能让项目每次运行时做不同的事情。

00:16:47.280 --> 00:16:50.810
And so just for fun I might say, when the flag is clicked--
所以只是为了好玩，我可以说，当点击绿旗时——

00:16:50.810 --> 00:16:53.000
let's go ahead and go to Motion--
我们直接去“运动”板块——

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:57.020
and have the hedgehog point in a particular direction.
并让刺猬朝向特定的方向。

00:16:57.020 --> 00:16:59.970
And instead of always pointing in direction 90,
而不是一直朝向90度方向，

00:16:59.970 --> 00:17:05.660
let's have the hedgehog pick a random number between 0 and 90.
让刺猬选取一个0到90之间的随机数。

00:17:05.660 --> 00:17:10.010
And we've put that value inside of this Point In Direction block--
我们把这个值放到了“朝向”积木里——

00:17:10.010 --> 00:17:13.530
and so, now every time I press the green flag, what's going to happen?
那么，现在每次我点击绿旗，会发生什么呢？

00:17:13.530 --> 00:17:16.460
We're going to pick a random number between 0 and 90,
我们会选取一个0到90之间的随机数，

00:17:16.460 --> 00:17:19.832
and the hedgehog is then going to point in that direction.
然后刺猬就会朝向那个方向。

00:17:19.832 --> 00:17:20.540
So I can try it--
所以我来试试——

00:17:20.540 --> 00:17:24.530
I'll press the green flag, and the hedgehog tilts slightly.
我点击绿旗，刺猬稍微倾斜了。

00:17:24.530 --> 00:17:27.502
I'll press it again, now it's facing a totally different direction--
我再点击一次，现在它朝向了完全不同的方向——

00:17:27.502 --> 00:17:29.960
I'll press it again, now it's facing a different direction.
我再点击一次，现在它又朝向了另一个不同的方向。

00:17:29.960 --> 00:17:32.450
And every time I press the flag, it's going
每次我点击绿旗，它都会

00:17:32.450 --> 00:17:35.330
to calculate a random number between 0 and 90,
计算一个0到90之间的随机数，

00:17:35.330 --> 00:17:40.110
and the hedgehog is then going to point in that direction.
然后刺猬就会朝向那个方向。

00:17:40.110 --> 00:17:42.737
And so randomness can add a little bit of fun to your projects
所以随机性可以为你的项目增添一些乐趣

00:17:42.737 --> 00:17:44.570
as well so that there's something surprising
这样每次运行项目时都会有惊喜

00:17:44.570 --> 00:17:47.090
every time you run the project-- where it's not always going
不会每次都是一样的情况。

00:17:47.090 --> 00:17:51.650
to be the same thing every single time.
好的，我们已经看到了一些可以在“运动”模块里使用的值，

00:17:51.650 --> 00:17:55.520
All right, so we've seen some values that we can use inside of Motion,
还有“外观”模块里的，并且我们也看到了一些“运算”模块

00:17:55.520 --> 00:17:57.680
and inside of Looks, and we've seen some Operators
我们可以用它们来做一些数学运算、把东西组合起来，

00:17:57.680 --> 00:18:00.320
we can use to do some math to join things together,
选取一些随机数。

00:18:00.320 --> 00:18:01.980
to pick some random numbers.
如果我们继续寻找其他的值——

00:18:01.980 --> 00:18:04.372
If we keep looking around for other values--
我接着往下滚动，我在找

00:18:04.372 --> 00:18:06.080
I'll go ahead and scroll, and I'm looking
任何可能是椭圆形的东西，

00:18:06.080 --> 00:18:08.060
for anything that might be shaped like an oval,
有可能是我想用的。

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:10.530
potentially, that I might want to use.
有个引起我注意的值是这个——

00:18:10.530 --> 00:18:15.200
One thing that catches my attention is this value here--
它叫“计时器”。

00:18:15.200 --> 00:18:16.478
it's called Timer.
你可能还记得上次我们已经用过计时器了——

00:18:16.478 --> 00:18:19.520
And you might recall from last time that we have used the Timer already--
每个Scratch项目都有一个内置的计时器，

00:18:19.520 --> 00:18:22.130
every Scratch project has a built-in timer that's
它会计算自项目开始运行以来过去了多少秒。

00:18:22.130 --> 00:18:27.770
counting how many seconds have passed since we started running the project.
我们之前用它来控制项目里不同角色的时间。

00:18:27.770 --> 00:18:31.040
And we used that before to control the timing of our different sprites
但如果我们只是想知道自项目开始以来过去了多久，也可以用它。

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:33.240
that existed in this project as well.
我先把这些积木删掉，

00:18:33.240 --> 00:18:36.290
But we can also use this if we just want to know how long it's
让我们用“计时器”的值来做点什么，比如说——我们到“事件”模块——

00:18:36.290 --> 00:18:38.790
been since we started the project.
当角色被点击时，当我点击刺猬时——我们接着

00:18:38.790 --> 00:18:42.080
I'll go ahead and get rid of these blocks here,
让刺猬说出“计时器”的当前值。

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:45.500
let's use the Timer value for something, let's say-- let's go to Events--
我把刺猬的朝向改回90度。

00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:48.770
when the sprite is clicked, when I click on the hedgehog-- let's go ahead
当角色被点击时，当我点击这只刺猬时——我们接着来

00:18:48.770 --> 00:18:54.080
and have the hedgehog say whatever the value of the Timer is.
让这只刺猬说出计时器的当前数值。

00:18:54.080 --> 00:18:57.170
I'll go ahead and change the hedgehog's direction back to 90
我接着把刺猬的方向改回90度

00:18:57.170 --> 00:19:00.320
so it's still facing the right again, and now I'll
所以它又朝右了，现在我要

00:19:00.320 --> 00:19:04.160
press the green flag to start the project-- the project's now started.
点击绿色旗帜来启动项目——项目现在已启动。

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:06.710
And now when I click on the hedgehog, it says,
现在当我点击刺猬角色时，它会说

00:19:06.710 --> 00:19:10.730
"it's been 4.45 seconds since we started the project. "
“自项目启动以来已经过了4.45秒。”

00:19:10.730 --> 00:19:15.530
And I'll press it again, "it's been 9.90 seconds since we started the project, "
我再点击一次，“自项目启动以来已经过了9.90秒。”

00:19:15.530 --> 00:19:18.820
and honestly now I don't really need to know that number in all that much
说实话，现在我并不真的需要知道那个数字的

00:19:18.820 --> 00:19:19.320
detail.
具体细节。

00:19:19.320 --> 00:19:24.350
I don't care if it's 9.90 versus 9.91 for example I just want to know has it
比如，我不在乎是9.90还是9.91，我只想知道

00:19:24.350 --> 00:19:27.780
been nine seconds or 10 seconds or 11 seconds, for example.
例如，是过了9秒、10秒还是11秒。

00:19:27.780 --> 00:19:31.730
And so what I could do in this case is go back to Operators,
所以在这种情况下，我可以回到“运算”类别，

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:35.000
and there's an Operator here called Round.
这里有个叫“取整”的运算积木。

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:38.270
And Round, If you're familiar with it for math, just takes a number
如果你熟悉数学里的取整，“取整”就是取一个数字

00:19:38.270 --> 00:19:40.890
and rounds it to a whole number.
并把它四舍五入成整数。

00:19:40.890 --> 00:19:43.280
So if I have 9.9, it's just going to say,
所以如果我有9.9，它就会说

00:19:43.280 --> 00:19:47.480
you know what, let's call that 10-- it rounds up to 10 seconds.
这样吧，就把它当成10——四舍五入到10秒。

00:19:47.480 --> 00:19:51.230
So we'll take the Timer, put it inside of the Round Operator,
所以我们把“计时器”积木放到“取整”运算积木里，

00:19:51.230 --> 00:19:54.590
and we'll take the Round Operator and put it inside of the Say block.
再把“取整”运算积木放到“说”积木里。

00:19:54.590 --> 00:19:58.490
Now we're saying the rounded version of the timer for two seconds.
现在我们要说的是计时器取整后的数值，持续2秒。

00:19:58.490 --> 00:20:03.140
Now I click on it and it's been 58 seconds now, not 58 point something,
现在我点击它，显示已经过了58秒，而不是58点几，

00:20:03.140 --> 00:20:03.740
for example.
比如这样。

00:20:03.740 --> 00:20:07.580
I wait a few more seconds, now it's been 63 seconds
我再等几秒，现在自项目启动以来

00:20:07.580 --> 00:20:09.930
since the start of the project.
已经过了63秒。

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:12.050
And so these values give you a lot ability
所以这些数值能让你

00:20:12.050 --> 00:20:15.050
to know something about what's going on inside of the project.
了解项目内部的运行情况。

00:20:15.050 --> 00:20:18.180
And Scratch just figures out what each of these values
Scratch会自动算出这些数值

00:20:18.180 --> 00:20:21.180
should be-- it knows what the x position and y position
应该是多少——它知道任意角色的x坐标和y坐标

00:20:21.180 --> 00:20:22.960
and size is for any given sprite.
以及大小。

00:20:22.960 --> 00:20:26.140
It knows how long it's been since we started running the project,
它知道自项目开始运行以来过了多久，

00:20:26.140 --> 00:20:28.560
so it knows what the value of the timer should be.
所以它知道计时器的值应该是多少。

00:20:28.560 --> 00:20:32.760
But there are some other values that the user can have a little bit more control
但还有一些其他的数值，用户也能有更多的

00:20:32.760 --> 00:20:35.850
over as well, and that's where our projects can get even more
控制权，这就是我们的项目能变得更加

00:20:35.850 --> 00:20:38.500
interactive and even more interesting.
互动性更强、更有趣的地方。

00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:39.990
Let's take a look now--
现在让我们来看看——

00:20:39.990 --> 00:20:45.060
I'll go ahead and get rid of the hedgehog and we'll bring back the cat.
我先把刺猬角色去掉，然后把猫角色再拿出来。

00:20:45.060 --> 00:20:48.510
Let's take a look now at the Sensing section of blocks, which
现在让我们看看“侦测”类的积木，我们

00:20:48.510 --> 00:20:50.460
we haven't really looked at just yet.
还没仔细看过呢。

00:20:50.460 --> 00:20:52.470
But notice this block here--
但注意看这个积木——

00:20:52.470 --> 00:20:55.652
Ask What's Your Name And Wait--
“询问 你叫什么名字 并等待”——

00:20:55.652 --> 00:20:56.860
this is an interesting block.
这是个很有趣的积木。

00:20:56.860 --> 00:21:00.120
It is a function, it's shaped like all of those other function blocks,
它是个函数，它的形状和其他函数积木一样，

00:21:00.120 --> 00:21:02.880
and it seems to be asking the user a question.
而且它似乎在向用户提问。

00:21:02.880 --> 00:21:05.640
It's asking something like, what's your name?
它问的好像是“你叫什么名字？”

00:21:05.640 --> 00:21:08.040
And What's Your Name here, this, if you'll recall,
这里的“你叫什么名字”，如果你还记得的话，

00:21:08.040 --> 00:21:09.570
is the input to the function.
是这个函数的输入。

00:21:09.570 --> 00:21:11.880
Anything in this oval shape in a function
函数积木中任何这种椭圆形的部分

00:21:11.880 --> 00:21:13.920
block-- that's an input to the function.
——那就是函数的输入。

00:21:13.920 --> 00:21:16.800
It's telling this function what question should you ask--
它在告诉这个函数你应该问什么问题——

00:21:16.800 --> 00:21:18.810
by default, the question is, what's your name?
默认情况下，问题是“你叫什么名字？”

00:21:18.810 --> 00:21:22.860
But the question might be different, we could ask whatever question we want,
但问题可能不同，我们可以问任何我们想问的问题，

00:21:22.860 --> 00:21:25.270
but the user is going to type in an answer.
但用户会输入一个答案。

00:21:25.270 --> 00:21:29.460
And that answer is going to then be the output of this function,
那个答案随后将成为这个函数的输出，

00:21:29.460 --> 00:21:32.340
and we haven't really seen outputs too much just yet.
目前我们还没怎么看到过输出。

00:21:32.340 --> 00:21:35.130
These outputs, also called return values,
这些输出，也叫返回值，

00:21:35.130 --> 00:21:39.280
are values that come back after we run a function.
是我们运行一个函数后得到的值。

00:21:39.280 --> 00:21:41.430
And it turns out this Ask What's Your Name and Wait
结果发现“询问你叫什么名字并等待”

00:21:41.430 --> 00:21:43.620
block has a return value--
积木有一个返回值——

00:21:43.620 --> 00:21:48.180
and the return value is this value here, which is called answer.
这个返回值就是这里这个叫“答案”的值。

00:21:48.180 --> 00:21:51.030
This block here, answer, is going to be a value that
这里的“答案”积木将是一个存储

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:57.790
stores whatever it is the user typed in in response to that question.
用户针对那个问题输入的任何内容的值。

00:21:57.790 --> 00:22:01.170
So we can ask the user a question, and based on what the user answers,
所以我们可以问用户一个问题，根据用户的回答，

00:22:01.170 --> 00:22:05.830
we can use that answer later on in our program somewhere.
我们可以在程序的某个地方稍后使用那个答案。

00:22:05.830 --> 00:22:11.490
So let's give that a try, let's try that out and see what we can do.
所以让我们试试看，看看能做些什么。

00:22:11.490 --> 00:22:14.640
I want to say that, when the green flag is clicked when I first
我想说，当绿色旗帜被点击，当我第一次

00:22:14.640 --> 00:22:19.560
start this project, let's go to something
启动这个项目时，让我们来操作一下

00:22:19.560 --> 00:22:23.970
and choose the Ask What's Your Name and Wait block.
并选择“询问你叫什么名字并等待”积木。

00:22:23.970 --> 00:22:27.870
And when you do that, let's go ahead and just say it back to them.
当你这么做的时候，让我们直接把答案说给他们听。

00:22:27.870 --> 00:22:30.547
I'll go to Say, Say Hello for 2 Seconds.
我要选择“说 你好 2 秒”。

00:22:30.547 --> 00:22:32.880
I don't want you to say "hello" for two seconds though--
不过我不想让你说“你好”两秒——

00:22:32.880 --> 00:22:36.750
I want you to say the answer for two seconds.
我想让你把答案说两秒。

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:40.140
Whatever it is the user typed in when they were asked that question,
用户在被问到那个问题时输入的任何内容，

00:22:40.140 --> 00:22:43.620
that's going to be this return value called Answer.
那将是这个叫“答案”的返回值。

00:22:43.620 --> 00:22:46.350
And we're now using Answer later in the project
现在我们在项目的后面使用“答案”

00:22:46.350 --> 00:22:51.360
to say the answer for two seconds-- so now when I run this program,
来说出答案两秒——所以现在当我运行这个程序时，

00:22:51.360 --> 00:22:54.270
the cat asks the question "what's your name?"
猫会问“你叫什么名字？”

00:22:54.270 --> 00:22:57.420
And we haven't moved on in the program yet-- the program is waiting,
而且我们的程序还没有继续执行——程序在等待，

00:22:57.420 --> 00:22:59.430
and it's waiting for me to answer the question.
它在等我回答问题。

00:22:59.430 --> 00:23:05.760
It's waiting for me to type in my name, I'll type in Brian, I'll press Return,
它在等我输入我的名字，我输入布莱恩，然后按回车键，

00:23:05.760 --> 00:23:08.613
and the cat now says my name back to me.
现在猫把我的名字说给我听。

00:23:08.613 --> 00:23:11.280
And if I wanted to, I could make it a little bit more friendly--
如果我愿意，我可以让它显得更友好一些——

00:23:11.280 --> 00:23:14.190
I can go into Operators and let's use that Join again.
我可以进入“运算符”，然后再次使用“连接”。

00:23:14.190 --> 00:23:21.820
Instead of saying answer, let's have it say Hello comma and then the answer.
别让它说“answer”了，让它说“Hello,” 然后再加上答案。

00:23:21.820 --> 00:23:25.110
So I'm using that Join Operator to combine two values together
所以我用那个连接运算符把两个值组合在一起。

00:23:25.110 --> 00:23:27.970
and I'm using that inside of the Say block.
我是在“说”积木里用的这个运算符。

00:23:27.970 --> 00:23:33.270
Now, when I press the green flag, "what's your name? " I say, Brian,
现在，我按下绿色小旗，它问“你叫什么名字？” 我回答“Brian”。

00:23:33.270 --> 00:23:37.210
and the cat says, "hello, Brian," for example.
然后这只猫就会说“hello, Brian”，举个例子。

00:23:37.210 --> 00:23:41.760
And so we can ask the user questions and use their answer inside of the program,
这样我们就能问用户问题，还能在程序里用上他们的答案。

00:23:41.760 --> 00:23:44.070
and that opens up a lot of interesting doors
这就为我们用Scratch项目能做的事打开了很多有趣的大门。

00:23:44.070 --> 00:23:46.770
for what it is that we can do with our Scratch project.
对于我们能用Scratch项目做什么而言。

00:23:46.770 --> 00:23:51.360
Remember, before, we'd been using Move to move a certain number of steps,
还记得吧，之前我们用“移动”积木让角色移动一定的步数。

00:23:51.360 --> 00:23:54.720
and we can say move 10 steps, or move 20 steps for example.
比如我们可以说移动10步，或者移动20步。

00:23:54.720 --> 00:24:00.510
Let's ask the user how far we want to move, let's ask, how many steps?
咱们问问用户想让角色移动多远，就问“移动多少步？”

00:24:00.510 --> 00:24:04.410
And then instead of moving 10 steps, we'll go into Sensing,
然后别写移动10步了，我们到“侦测”分类里找。

00:24:04.410 --> 00:24:05.550
we'll grab the answer--
把答案拿过来。

00:24:05.550 --> 00:24:08.590
that return value, and let's Move Answer Steps.
就是那个返回值，然后用 “移动（答案）步”。

00:24:08.590 --> 00:24:12.810
Whatever the user typed in, that's how many steps I want to move.
用户输入多少，我就让角色移动多少步。

00:24:12.810 --> 00:24:16.600
So I'll drag the cat back to the left hand side, I'll press the flag--
我把猫拖回舞台左边，按下小旗。

00:24:16.600 --> 00:24:21.600
"how many steps? " Or if I type in 10, we move 10 steps.
它问“移动多少步？” 如果我输入10，它就移动10步。

00:24:21.600 --> 00:24:22.690
Let's try it again--
咱们再试一次。

00:24:22.690 --> 00:24:25.860
"how many steps? " I'll type in 50, something bigger.
“移动多少步？” 我输入个大点儿的数，比如50。

00:24:25.860 --> 00:24:27.540
Now we move 50 steps.
现在它移动了50步。

00:24:27.540 --> 00:24:30.240
Press it again-- "how many steps? " Let's try 200,
再按一次小旗，它问“移动多少步？” 试试200。

00:24:30.240 --> 00:24:33.340
and the cat moves 200 steps when I type in that number.
我输入这个数后，猫就移动了200步。

00:24:33.340 --> 00:24:37.200
So whatever number I type in, that's the Return value of the Function
所以我输入的任何数字，就是这个函数的返回值。

00:24:37.200 --> 00:24:38.910
that becomes the Answer.
这个返回值就成了答案。

00:24:38.910 --> 00:24:42.510
And because I'm using the Answer inside of this Move some number of steps
因为我在 “移动（）步” 这个积木里用了答案。

00:24:42.510 --> 00:24:45.150
block, that's going to result in me-- the user--
这就意味着我——也就是用户。

00:24:45.150 --> 00:24:48.420
being able to control as by typing it into my keyboard
可以通过键盘输入来控制。

00:24:48.420 --> 00:24:51.750
how far I actually want the cat to move.
我到底想让猫移动多远。

00:24:51.750 --> 00:24:54.210
And I can use this for other blocks too--
我也能把这方法用在其他积木上。

00:24:54.210 --> 00:24:57.030
we've seen before that we have the ability
我们之前看到过。

00:24:57.030 --> 00:25:01.260
to set the x value to something, to make it go somewhere,
我们可以把x坐标设成某个值，让角色移到某个地方。

00:25:01.260 --> 00:25:03.930
and we've also seen that we can set the y value to something
我们也看到过可以把y坐标设成某个值。

00:25:03.930 --> 00:25:05.470
to have it go somewhere else.
让角色移到另一个地方。

00:25:05.470 --> 00:25:13.680
So I can ask Pick x, and then let's set x to that answer.
所以我可以问 “选个x坐标”，然后把x坐标设成那个答案。

00:25:13.680 --> 00:25:21.910
Then ask Pick y and set y to the new answer--
再问 “选个y坐标”，把y坐标设成新的答案。

00:25:21.910 --> 00:25:25.030
so now I press the green flag, Pick x.
现在我按下绿色小旗，它问 “选个x坐标”。

00:25:25.030 --> 00:25:31.290
Let's pick 50, Pick y--
选50，然后它问 “选个y坐标”。

00:25:31.290 --> 00:25:35.530
let's pick negative 100--
选 -100。

00:25:35.530 --> 00:25:38.170
and the cat goes to 50 and negative 100.
然后猫就移到了坐标（50， -100）的位置。

00:25:38.170 --> 00:25:42.850
If I wanted to go back to the center, Pick x or Pick 0, Pick Y or Pick 0,
如果我想让它回到舞台中心，选x坐标为0，选y坐标也为0。

00:25:42.850 --> 00:25:45.210
and the cat goes back to the center.
然后猫回到中心位置。

00:25:45.210 --> 00:25:47.620
And so you can ask multiple questions too-- each time
所以你也可以问多个问题——每次

00:25:47.620 --> 00:25:51.970
Answer is whatever the answer was to the most recent question.
答案就是最近那个问题的回答内容。

00:25:51.970 --> 00:25:54.220
And using the answers to those questions,
通过这些问题的答案，

00:25:54.220 --> 00:25:57.340
we can start to do some interesting things.
我们可以开始做一些有趣的事情了。

00:25:57.340 --> 00:26:00.580
We can have the cat move around to various different places,
我们可以让猫移动到不同的地方，

00:26:00.580 --> 00:26:04.940
and we can even use this in other blocks to control our project as well.
我们甚至还能在其他积木里用它来控制我们的项目。

00:26:04.940 --> 00:26:07.360
Let's get rid of the cat for now and bring back
现在我们先把猫去掉，然后把

00:26:07.360 --> 00:26:10.870
another animal we've used before-- we'll bring back the bear.
之前用过的另一个角色请回来——我们把熊请回来。

00:26:10.870 --> 00:26:14.140
And the bear has a few costumes you might remember--
你们可能还记得，这只熊有好几种造型——

00:26:14.140 --> 00:26:17.320
if we go into costumes for the bear, we see that there's this one costume
如果我们进入熊的造型界面，会看到有一个造型

00:26:17.320 --> 00:26:19.730
called Bear A-- where the bear looks like this--
叫“熊A”——熊看起来是这样的——

00:26:19.730 --> 00:26:25.450
and there's another costume called Bear B where the bear looks like that.
还有另一个叫“熊B”的造型，熊看起来是那样的。

00:26:25.450 --> 00:26:28.420
I'm going to go ahead and rename these costumes-- it turns out
我要接着给这些造型重新命名——结果发现

00:26:28.420 --> 00:26:31.120
you can name costumes whatever you want to call them,
你可以随意给造型命名，

00:26:31.120 --> 00:26:34.090
but I'm going to call this costume 4.
但我要把这个造型命名为4。

00:26:34.090 --> 00:26:37.420
Just the number 4 because the bear is on four legs--
就叫数字4，因为熊是四脚着地的——

00:26:37.420 --> 00:26:39.475
and I'll give this costume a name too, I'll
我也给这个造型起个名字，我

00:26:39.475 --> 00:26:44.260
give it the name 2 because the bear is on two legs.
把它命名为2，因为熊是两脚站立的。

00:26:44.260 --> 00:26:45.560
Now, why am I doing this?
现在，我为什么要这么做呢？

00:26:45.560 --> 00:26:49.750
Well, it's because of what I'm about to show you, which is let's add an event--
嗯，这是因为我接下来要给你们展示的内容，也就是添加一个事件——

00:26:49.750 --> 00:26:53.920
when the flag is clicked, I want to ask a question,
当点击绿旗时，我要问一个问题，

00:26:53.920 --> 00:26:59.380
and the question I'm going to ask is, "how many legs? "
我要问的问题是：“有几条腿？”

00:26:59.380 --> 00:27:04.570
And now what I'll do is I'll go into Looks and I'll say Switch Costume To.
现在我要做的是，进入外观模块，然后选择“换成造型”。

00:27:04.570 --> 00:27:09.610
And notice that Switch Costume To also has an oval-shaped input next to it.
注意，“换成造型”旁边也有一个椭圆形的输入框。

00:27:09.610 --> 00:27:12.820
This oval-shaped input is a dropdown where I could choose which costume I
这个椭圆形输入框是个下拉菜单，我可以从中选择我想让

00:27:12.820 --> 00:27:14.950
want the bear to use--
熊使用的造型——

00:27:14.950 --> 00:27:20.050
but because it's oval-shaped, I can just put my own value inside of that oval
但因为它是椭圆形的，如果我愿意，

00:27:20.050 --> 00:27:21.790
if I want to.
可以直接在椭圆形里输入自己的值。

00:27:21.790 --> 00:27:24.250
And let's, instead of using the dropdown,
我们不使用下拉菜单了，

00:27:24.250 --> 00:27:28.250
let's just have it go to the answer.
让它直接切换到答案对应的造型。

00:27:28.250 --> 00:27:30.250
And so now I press the green flag--
现在我点击绿旗——

00:27:30.250 --> 00:27:36.340
the bear asks "how many legs? " Let's say four legs for the bear--
熊问“有几条腿？” 假设熊有四条腿——

00:27:36.340 --> 00:27:38.113
and now the bear's on four legs.
现在熊就四脚着地了。

00:27:38.113 --> 00:27:40.780
If I want the bear to stand up, I'll press the green flag again,
如果我想让熊站起来，我再点击一次绿旗，

00:27:40.780 --> 00:27:45.340
it says "how many legs? " I press 2, and the bear stands up.
它问“有几条腿？” 我输入2，熊就站起来了。

00:27:45.340 --> 00:27:48.700
And, again, the reason that's happening is because when it asks how many legs,
再次说明，会出现这种情况的原因是，当它问有几条腿时，

00:27:48.700 --> 00:27:51.590
I type in something like 2 as my answer.
我输入了像2这样的答案。

00:27:51.590 --> 00:27:55.120
And so this block runs, we're going to Switch Costume To--
于是这个积木运行，我们要换成——

00:27:55.120 --> 00:27:57.070
in this case, 2--
在这种情况下，换成2——

00:27:57.070 --> 00:28:00.160
and because I named my costumes after those answers--
因为我用那些答案来命名我的造型——

00:28:00.160 --> 00:28:02.620
you'll remember that if I go back to the Costumes tab,
你应该还记得，如果我回到“造型”标签页，

00:28:02.620 --> 00:28:05.170
I had given those costumes particular names.
我给那些造型起了特定的名字。

00:28:05.170 --> 00:28:08.230
I called one of the costumes 4, for the four leg version,
我把其中一个造型命名为4，代表四条腿的版本，

00:28:08.230 --> 00:28:11.410
and one of the costumes 2 for the two leg version.
把另一个造型命名为2，代表两条腿的版本。

00:28:11.410 --> 00:28:15.610
Well then I can use those blocks to control how many legs the bear is
那么我就可以用这些积木来控制熊最终

00:28:15.610 --> 00:28:17.170
ultimately going to be standing on.
要站在几条腿上。

00:28:17.170 --> 00:28:18.970
And that works for costumes, and it works
这对造型适用，而且

00:28:18.970 --> 00:28:22.460
for other parts of Scratch's interface, like backdrops, for example.
对Scratch界面的其他部分也适用，比如背景。

00:28:22.460 --> 00:28:23.710
So we could try that out too--
所以我们也可以试试看——

00:28:23.710 --> 00:28:26.560
I'll go ahead and get rid of the--
我先把……去掉

00:28:26.560 --> 00:28:30.200
we'll keep the bear for now, but I'll get rid of the question.
目前我们先保留这只熊，但我要把问题去掉。

00:28:30.200 --> 00:28:34.150
Let's add some backdrops, let's add Colorful City.
我们来添加一些背景，添加“多彩城市”。

00:28:34.150 --> 00:28:37.540
I like the look of that, the colorful city during the day,
我喜欢这个样子，白天的多彩城市，

00:28:37.540 --> 00:28:39.070
and let's add one more backdrop.
我们再添加一个背景。

00:28:39.070 --> 00:28:45.310
Let's add the Night City, so we have a couple different backdrops
我们添加“夜间城市”，这样我们就有几个不同的背景了

00:28:45.310 --> 00:28:47.800
and I'm going to change their names.
我要给它们改个名字。

00:28:47.800 --> 00:28:51.490
This Colorful city, I'm going to call it Day--
这个“多彩城市”，我要叫它“白天”——

00:28:51.490 --> 00:28:55.450
and again, just up at the top here, I can change the name of this backdrop.
同样，就在这里的顶部，我可以更改这个背景的名字。

00:28:55.450 --> 00:29:00.100
And for the Night City, I'm going to call it Night.
对于“夜间城市”，我要叫它“夜晚”。

00:29:00.100 --> 00:29:07.540
So I have one backdrop called Day and one backdrop that I've called Night--
所以我有一个叫“白天”的背景和一个叫“夜晚”的背景——

00:29:07.540 --> 00:29:10.270
and let's go back into the code.
我们回到代码区。

00:29:10.270 --> 00:29:12.460
And now for the bear--
现在对于这只熊——

00:29:12.460 --> 00:29:15.460
when the flag is clicked, I want the bear to ask a question.
当点击绿旗时，我希望这只熊问一个问题。

00:29:19.250 --> 00:29:22.080
"What time? " Like, what time of day is it?
“什么时间？” 比如，现在是一天中的什么时间？

00:29:22.080 --> 00:29:28.752
And let's go ahead and switch the backdrop to whatever the answer is.
我们接着把背景切换成答案对应的背景。

00:29:28.752 --> 00:29:30.710
So the bear is going to ask me what time of day
所以这只熊会问我想要什么时间

00:29:30.710 --> 00:29:34.280
do I want-- if I say day, that's one possible answer, if I say night, that's
如果我说白天，那是一种可能的答案，如果我说夜晚，那是

00:29:34.280 --> 00:29:35.672
another possible answer.
另一种可能的答案。

00:29:35.672 --> 00:29:36.380
So we'll try it--
我们来试试看——

00:29:36.380 --> 00:29:39.380
I'll press the flag, "what time? " I'll say night--
我点击绿旗，“什么时间？” 我回答夜晚——

00:29:39.380 --> 00:29:43.130
I'll press Return, and now it's nighttime.
我按回车键，现在是夜晚了。

00:29:43.130 --> 00:29:44.480
I'll try it again--
我再试一次——

00:29:44.480 --> 00:29:49.760
"what time of day? " I'll say day, and now it's daytime.
“一天中的什么时间？” 我回答白天，现在是白天了。

00:29:49.760 --> 00:29:52.610
And so using this ability now to have Return values,
现在利用这种获取返回值的能力，

00:29:52.610 --> 00:29:55.520
we can create much more interactive and much more exciting
我们可以通过让用户告诉我们一些信息

00:29:55.520 --> 00:29:58.280
programs by letting the user tell us something
并在项目中运用这些答案，创建出更具交互性、更有趣的

00:29:58.280 --> 00:30:00.080
and using that answer in the project.
程序。

00:30:00.080 --> 00:30:02.780
Letting them type in their name and responding to them by name,
让他们输入自己的名字，然后用名字回应他们，

00:30:02.780 --> 00:30:05.540
or letting them type in what backdrop or costume they want,
或者让他们输入想要的背景或造型，

00:30:05.540 --> 00:30:07.670
or letting them type in how they want to control--
或者让他们输入自己想要的控制方式——

00:30:07.670 --> 00:30:11.150
how sprite moves, or where it's pointing, or in what direction
比如角色如何移动、指向哪里，或者朝哪个方向移动。

00:30:11.150 --> 00:30:12.420
it's going for example.
举个例子。

00:30:12.420 --> 00:30:14.570
And so you give the user a lot more control
所以，仅仅通过利用这些数值，你就能让用户对正在发生的事情有更多的控制权。

00:30:14.570 --> 00:30:18.677
over what's happening just by taking advantage of these values.
通过利用这些数值来了解正在发生的事情。

00:30:18.677 --> 00:30:21.510
That's it for an Introduction to Programming with Scratch for today.
今天的Scratch编程入门就讲到这里。

00:30:21.510 --> 00:30:23.240
Next time, we'll continue this discussion
下次，我们将继续这个讨论。

00:30:23.240 --> 00:30:25.130
and to take a look at some other features
并看看Scratch编程世界中的其他一些特性。

00:30:25.130 --> 00:30:28.780
that we get in this world of programming with Scratch.
这是我们在Scratch编程世界中所获得的。
